 "entry": "noticeboard.app.build_app, the route GET /families/chat/edit",
 "format": 1,
 "notes": ["The input is one request for the edit page. args.cookie is the value of its Cookie header. A text stands for the UTF-8 bytes of the text, a $base64 marker holds bytes that are not UTF-8, and null stands for a request with no such header.","params.cookie_secure is the switch of the config for Secure on the cookie. Each input has one vector for each state of the switch.","value.token is the value of the form field csrf_token on the page. It is the token that the service read from the request. It is null when the service minted a token: such a token is random.","value.set_cookie is the value of each Set-Cookie header of the answer. The text $TOKEN stands for a token that the service minted.","The web framework decodes the bytes of a header as Latin-1. The service reads the last cookie of the name. It removes the whitespace of Python str.strip from the two ends of a name and of a value. It removes one pair of double quotes around a value.","Between the two quotes, the service reads two escape forms. A backslash and three octal digits, the first of them 0 to 3, are the character of that number. A backslash and one other character are that character.","The cookie writer of Python puts a value between double quotes when the value holds a character that is no letter, no digit and none of !#$%&'*+-.^_`|~:","The vector each-quoted-mark holds each other character of a cookie-octet: ()/<=>?@[]{}","The generator sends each request two times. A token that differs between the two answers is a minted token.","The service of the generator binds loopback and has no access key. Its state root and its registry are empty directories, and its attendance answers each call with no session.","The generator gives the app the request with no server and no client between the two. The app gets the raw path, the path with each percent escape decoded as UTF-8, the bytes of the query and the bytes of each header, as it gets them from its server."],
